{
  "format": 0,
  "id": "isfahan-sayyed-crosses",
  "title": "Stars and crosses of the Masjid-e Sayyed (Isfahan)",
  "short": "Masjid-e Sayyed crosses",
  "subtitle": "Masjid-e Sayyed, Isfahan",
  "given": {"O": "The centre of a star.", "A": "A point of that star."},
  "fold": 4,
  "star": 8,
  "style": "Persian",
  "level": "advanced",
  "construction": {
    "basis": "reconstruction",
    "fidelity": "not-applicable",
    "note": "The finished design was read from Wichmann’s IRA1617 drawing. Its tile corners were snapped to the square-root-of-two grid with the star’s point radius as the unit. The stars stand two apart along the lines of a larger pattern, so every line is at one of a few distances from O, or at the same distances from the corner of the tile. The opening is shared with the Seyyed mosque stars (IRAN2), drawn in the same frame. The drawing gives no steps; we devised the construction.",
    "changes": "The compass steps, their order and the named points are ours. The tile edges follow the plain drawing; its white strokes over the joints are not bands. Wichmann also draws the larger pattern as lines over the pieces; those lines are not inked here. The colours follow his drawing. Wade’s photograph was not overlaid.",
    "reviewed": "2026-10-26"
  },
  "credits": [
    {
      "source": "Tiling Search, data201/IRA1617: Masjid-e Sayyed, Isfahan",
      "creator": "Brian Wichmann",
      "kind": "drawing",
      "url": "https://tilingsearch.mit.edu/HTML/data201/IRA1617.html",
      "note": "Read from his finished drawing, not construction instructions. His references are David Wade’s photograph IRA 1617 (Masjid-e Sayyed, Isfahan, 1840) and Wichmann and Wade, Islamic Design: a Mathematical Approach (2017), figures 15.1a and 15.1b."
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Draw a horizontal straight line through O and A. Draw a circle with centre O through A.",
      "create": {"c": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "A"}}, "h": {"line": {"through": ["O", "A"]}}},
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Draw a vertical line through O. It crosses the circle at C and D. The horizontal line crosses the circle at B on the left. Draw a vertical line through A. Draw a horizontal line through C. They cross at E. Draw a straight line through O and E. Draw a line through O at 90° to line OE. The circle crosses the four lines through O at S1 to S8.",
      "create": {
        "v": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "B": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "C": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "D": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}},
        "ax": {"line": {"through": "A", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "cy": {"line": {"through": "C", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "E": {"point": {"meet": ["ax", "cy"]}},
        "d45": {"line": {"through": ["O", "E"]}},
        "d135": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "S1": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 0.0}}},
        "S2": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 45.0}}},
        "S3": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "S4": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "d135"], "pick": {"angle": 135.0}}},
        "S5": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "S6": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 225.0}}},
        "S7": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}},
        "S8": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "d135"], "pick": {"angle": 315.0}}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Draw the star at O as two squares.",
      "animate": "ruler",
      "parts": [
        {
          "text": "Draw a straight line through S1 and S3, S3 and S5, S5 and S7, and S7 and S1. Draw each line long, beyond the circle.",
          "create": {
            "q01": {"line": {"through": ["S1", "S3"]}},
            "q02": {"line": {"through": ["S3", "S5"]}},
            "q03": {"line": {"through": ["S5", "S7"]}},
            "q04": {"line": {"through": ["S7", "S1"]}}
          },
          "animate": "ruler"
        },
        {
          "text": "Draw a straight line through S2 and S4, S4 and S6, S6 and S8, and S8 and S2. Draw each line long, beyond the circle.",
          "create": {
            "q11": {"line": {"through": ["S2", "S4"]}},
            "q12": {"line": {"through": ["S4", "S6"]}},
            "q13": {"line": {"through": ["S6", "S8"]}},
            "q14": {"line": {"through": ["S8", "S2"]}}
          },
          "animate": "ruler"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Keep the compass open to OA. Draw circles with centres A, F1 and F2 in turn. Each circle crosses the horizontal line to the right at F1, F2 and F.",
      "create": {
        "cf0": {"circle": {"centre": "A", "radiusOf": "c"}},
        "F1": {"point": {"meet": ["cf0", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cf1": {"circle": {"centre": "F1", "radiusOf": "c"}},
        "F2": {"point": {"meet": ["cf1", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cf2": {"circle": {"centre": "F2", "radiusOf": "c"}},
        "F": {"point": {"meet": ["cf2", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Keep the compass open to OE. Draw circles with centres F and G1 in turn. Each circle crosses the horizontal line to the right at G1 and G2.",
      "create": {
        "cg1": {"circle": {"centre": "F", "radiusFrom": ["O", "E"]}},
        "G1": {"point": {"meet": ["cg1", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cg2": {"circle": {"centre": "G1", "radiusFrom": ["O", "E"]}},
        "G2": {"point": {"meet": ["cg2", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Draw a circle with centre O through G2. It crosses the horizontal and vertical lines at T1 to T4.",
      "create": {
        "co": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "G2"}},
        "T1": {"point": {"meet": ["co", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 0.0}}},
        "T2": {"point": {"meet": ["co", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90.0}}},
        "T3": {"point": {"meet": ["co", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180.0}}},
        "T4": {"point": {"meet": ["co", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270.0}}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "The vertical side from S8 to S2 crosses the horizontal line at P. Keep the compass open to OP. Draw circles with centres A, F1 and F2 in turn. They cross the horizontal line at U and V, at M and N, and at Y, towards O. Draw a circle with centre P and radius OE. It crosses the horizontal line at J, beyond P. Draw a vertical line through each of J, U, V, M, N and Y. Turn the six new lines round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {
        "P": {"point": {"meet": ["q14", "h"]}},
        "cA": {"circle": {"centre": "A", "radiusFrom": ["O", "P"]}},
        "U": {"point": {"meet": ["cA", "h"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "V": {"point": {"meet": ["cA", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cF1": {"circle": {"centre": "F1", "radiusFrom": ["O", "P"]}},
        "M": {"point": {"meet": ["cF1", "h"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "N": {"point": {"meet": ["cF1", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cF2": {"circle": {"centre": "F2", "radiusFrom": ["O", "P"]}},
        "Y": {"point": {"meet": ["cF2", "h"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "cp": {"circle": {"centre": "P", "radiusFrom": ["O", "E"]}},
        "J": {"point": {"meet": ["cp", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 0.0}}},
        "vJ": {"line": {"through": "J", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "vU": {"line": {"through": "U", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "vV": {"line": {"through": "V", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "vM": {"line": {"through": "M", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "vN": {"line": {"through": "N", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "vY": {"line": {"through": "Y", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "vp": {"repeat": {"of": ["vJ", "vU", "vV", "vM", "vN", "vY"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Draw four circles with centre T1. Their radii are OP, OJ, OM and ON. They cross the horizontal line at Z1, Z2, Z3 and Z4, towards O. Draw a vertical line through each of Z1 to Z4. Turn the four new lines round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {
        "ct1": {"circle": {"centre": "T1", "radiusFrom": ["O", "P"]}},
        "Z1": {"point": {"meet": ["ct1", "h"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "vz1": {"line": {"through": "Z1", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "ct2": {"circle": {"centre": "T1", "radiusFrom": ["O", "J"]}},
        "Z2": {"point": {"meet": ["ct2", "h"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "vz2": {"line": {"through": "Z2", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "ct3": {"circle": {"centre": "T1", "radiusFrom": ["O", "M"]}},
        "Z3": {"point": {"meet": ["ct3", "h"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "vz3": {"line": {"through": "Z3", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "ct4": {"circle": {"centre": "T1", "radiusFrom": ["O", "N"]}},
        "Z4": {"point": {"meet": ["ct4", "h"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "vz4": {"line": {"through": "Z4", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "vzp": {"repeat": {"of": ["vz1", "vz2", "vz3", "vz4"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "Draw circles with centre O through J, N and Z4. They cross line OE at R1, R2 and R3. Draw a line through each of R1, R2 and R3 at 90° to line OE. Turn the three new lines round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {
        "co1": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "J"}},
        "R1": {"point": {"meet": ["co1", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 45.0}}},
        "dr1": {"line": {"through": "R1", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "co2": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "N"}},
        "R2": {"point": {"meet": ["co2", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 45.0}}},
        "dr2": {"line": {"through": "R2", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "co3": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "Z4"}},
        "R3": {"point": {"meet": ["co3", "d45"], "pick": {"angle": 45.0}}},
        "dr3": {"line": {"through": "R3", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}},
        "drp": {"repeat": {"of": ["dr1", "dr2", "dr3"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "Join T1, T2, T3 and T4 to mark the tile that repeats.",
      "create": {"tile": {"polygon": ["T1", "T2", "T3", "T4"]}},
      "animate": "fade"
    }
